 # Phase 8: Senior Developer

+## Playwright Gate (Frontend Stories)
+
+For any frontend story (Acceptance Diff contains `.tsx`/`.jsx`/`.css` files or
+seed mentions "dashboard", "UI", "frontend"), Phase 8 MUST:
+
+1. Run `npx playwright test --grep @smoke` and confirm GREEN before reporting complete.
+2. Commit any new `e2e/screenshots/` baselines alongside the implementation code.
+3. Verify the CI `playwright-frontend-tests` job passes on the PR before marking Done.
+
